NAME: ColrOrgn

DESCRIPTION:

The Color Organ display is selectable:
- BARS:    Vertical bars
- CIRCLES: Circles
- FFT:     Fast Fourier Transform

Filter options:
- SNAP: intensity snaps to higher level,
        then gradually reduces
- EXP:  exponential smoothing
- NONE: no filtering

Tap the upper or lower area of the bar,
circle, or fft, to adjust scale.

Portrait and Landscape orientations are
supported.

To make a recording:
- select MON/REC
- select Share one app
- run the App, for example YT Music, 
  and start playing
- switch back to ezApp
- select REC to start the recording
- when done, select STOP
- enter filename

To play a file:
- select the file

NOTES:

KISS FFT is used: 'A mixed-radix Fast 
Fourier Transform based up on the 
principle, "Keep It Simple, Stupid."'.
https://github.com/mborgerding/kissfft
